<description>&lt;p&gt;Malian forces and their Russian allies are conducting indiscriminate drone strikes that have killed 94 civilians, while both the Malian army and rebel groups are committing abuses against civilians. In Nigeria, terrorists killed soldiers at a Borno military post and a convoy attack in Borno resulted in the loss of 15 soldiers and task force members. Burkina Faso, Niger and Mali have resumed talks with ECOWAS after a withdrawal, indicating diplomatic engagement alongside the violence. The conflict remains deadly, with 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQekJZS0Nab2NieDNYRjhYdU1xQXduZ1pwUGREVjdKZl96eWV1TGdrSEJPOUJVODlZdnpmVUJ4eVNFZXpxZk5zY1dESlUxWDVZSnNueXVsTVFRY0V0djFRSEtibDMyOURzT3FUaFV6ekUzejVuQVJMR2VlRGh2THZWUUI5cEtvdnZUYzg0Qm8ycUctMGVHVWo1QnRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNOXdCV2M0QThrQnhVSnUyVC0xQXEteEpiTHJGcjB5WUJGQllnTGZTa082N1JnU1lWRC1FWi1HSTlMTWY1QXlkeVZHN3pEVmg5X0pmaGxoR3dyYnB0RG1FZm1IVXNEcnNrbnBPcFRxd2xZZmFYaUM4bjVSQWRBeWYxRWRsTk8tRGxMRkNJTWRmQUFyelg5Z2tycw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arise News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNcFJQbXJjZ0QySUFpVDN5dGptSE8xQzF1bGE1VkUyN0xtajYxeW9zTkNhUUhJaFowOFQ1cHlkQkFvd2FtRlVwWW9qdmpsby0ta3F0cWtWM1M1T3VIWkdkY1hrTlJsekszdDEwZTR0YTh3bi1VajdxZGxualJvOXVzRU5UMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastern Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;UNITED24 Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE02cm84NWlBMVVSV1NFa1ZqQ0dEUy1LMVVMWkNhMUpmcV9Lc1J5cnlRMUlFLWVzWndzcHozUUpJanpqaEFIUDZNQzliWERNUFNh?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASIAN SCHOLAR | Sass Roga